# Source is text, stored with LF (core.autocrlf gives CRLF in the working tree). Said outright so that a stray CR (a CR CR LF a script
# wrote) cannot make git take a file for binary, as it did hooks.cpp: no text diff, and every merge a whole-file conflict.
*.cpp text
*.h text
*.py text
*.java text
*.csv text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.def text
*.bat text eol=crlf
